  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">KTH Swedesurvey fas 8-10</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">KTH Swedesurvey phase8-10</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">KTHs masterprogrammet har startad sin 8 fas (startade med Sida-st&#xf6;d 1996). Swedesurvey har varit med sedan starten och koordinerat en del av utbildningen i Land Information systems, vilket har varit h&#xf6;gst relevant i programmet. Swedesurvey har ocks&#xe5; h&#xe5;llit i f&#xf6;rberedande utbildning i Ryssland, vilket har varit av stort v&#xe4;rde n&#xe4;r KTH senare skall anta studenter. Denna fas p&#xe5;g&#xe5;r tom l&#xe4;s&#xe5;ret 2006-7.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The programme &quot;Master of Science in Land Management&quot; has started its 8th phase at KTH. Swedesurvey has since the start coordinated some of the training in Land Information Systems, which has been most relevant in this programme.Swedesurvey has also carried out  preparation training for Russian applicants, which has been valuable to KTH when accepting students.</narrative>
  </description>
